# Styling

## Palette (Tailwind tokens in `app/globals.css` @theme)

Use token classes — do not hardcode hex in components:

| Token | Hex | Meaning |
|-------|-----|---------|
| `navy` | `#0A1E3F` | base / surfaces |
| `coral` | `#FF4E78` | "Say" — voice, intent, primary CTA |
| `aqua` | `#19E0C8` | "So" — verified, proof, success |
| `azure` | `#2D7FF9` | building / tool activity |
| `sand` | `#FDFBF5` | primary text |
| `slate` | `#9AADC8` | secondary text (brightened for projector legibility) |

Semantic pairing: coral = speak/act, aqua = verified/done.

## Typography

- **Display / hero:** `font-display` → Bricolage Grotesque (`app/layout.tsx`)
- **Body:** Geist Sans (`font-sans`)
- **Build stream:** Geist Mono (`font-mono` on `BuildStream`)

Logo: `/public/say-so-logo.png` via `next/image` in `page.tsx` header.

## Layout patterns

Single screen, no scroll required for demo:
1. Logo + tagline
2. `MicButton` + status bar (phase progress line in `StatusBar`)
3. Asymmetric panels: build stream `lg:col-span-3`, proof `lg:col-span-2`

Panels use `FrostedPanel`: `bg-white/[0.03]`, `backdrop-blur`, `border-white/[0.08]`.

Background: gradient mesh + `.grain-overlay` in `layout.tsx` — edit in `globals.css`, not inline on page.

## Proof reveal

`ProofPanel` uses Motion (`motion/react`) + `.proof-glow-once` in `globals.css`. Parent must stay `overflow-visible` when proof shows — glow is a box-shadow that gets clipped by `overflow-hidden`.

## Motion scope

Use Motion for proof reveal and badge only. Do not add scattered micro-animations that distract from the live build stream during a 2-minute demo.
